Origin and independence
------------------------
This is an INDEPENDENT, community-maintained desktop launcher for the
Open Integration Engine (OIE) / Mirth Connect Administrator client.

It is a clean-room implementation. It contains NO decompiled, copied, or
derived source from Mirth Connect or NextGen Healthcare, and it bundles no
proprietary client binaries. At launch it verifies and runs the Administrator
client that the user's OWN server provides over the network; it does not
contain or redistribute that client.

This launcher was originally built by Gestalt Diagnostics and released to the
community.

